WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.757 --> 00:00:02.257
KEVIN FEIGE
We always love doing the

00:00:02.308 --> 00:00:04.437
unexpected with Scott Lang.

00:00:04.488 --> 00:00:08.281
Ant-Man is arguably the character
that is the most underestimated.

00:00:08.488 --> 00:00:13.195
Ant-Man became the key to saving
the universe in Avengers: Endgame.

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:16.937
So, carrying that tradition,
we thought, well, let's use this film

00:00:16.988 --> 00:00:18.588
to kick off Phase 5.

00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:21.813
PAUL RUDD
It's been almost a decade now

00:00:21.864 --> 00:00:25.451
that I've been playing this part.
I've loved it and I feel protective

00:00:25.502 --> 00:00:27.950
of Scott Lang and Ant-Man.

00:00:28.016 --> 00:00:31.912
It's really nice coming back. I still
kinda can't believe that I'm sitting there

00:00:31.963 --> 00:00:34.975
and it's like, wow, there's Michelle
Pfeiffer and there's Michael Douglas.

00:00:35.085 --> 00:00:36.311
DR. HANK PYM
I just saved eight bucks.

00:00:36.362 --> 00:00:37.436
SCOTT LANG
God, I admire you.

00:00:37.487 --> 00:00:39.389
PAUL RUDD
It's really nice not to get used

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.967
to working with legends.

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:43.982
JANET VAN DYNE
You're sending a signal down

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:45.713
to the Quantum Realm?

00:00:47.285 --> 00:00:47.982
[Screams]

00:00:49.969 --> 00:00:51.286
CASSIE LANG
Where are we?

00:00:51.886 --> 00:00:54.245
JANET VAN DYNE
It's a secret universe beneath ours.

00:00:54.296 --> 00:00:56.732
MICHELLE PFEIFFER
Janet has been very quiet about

00:00:56.783 --> 00:00:58.700
her time in the Quantum Realm.

00:00:58.759 --> 00:01:01.615
Maybe would've, you know,
made different choices. [Laughing]

00:01:01.764 --> 00:01:04.017
JANET VAN DYNE
There's someone I never told you about.

00:01:04.069 --> 00:01:06.443
KANG THE CONQUEROR
This place isn't what you think.

00:01:06.494 --> 00:01:09.450
EVANGELINE LILLY
Kang the Conqueror is terrifying

00:01:09.508 --> 00:01:13.228
and if there ever was a maniac loose
in the Quantum Realm, it's him.

00:01:15.003 --> 00:01:18.286
JONATHAN MAJORS
Playing Kang the Conqueror is such a gift.

00:01:18.337 --> 00:01:19.683
KANG THE CONQUEROR
Your reality.

00:01:20.173 --> 00:01:23.702
Everything you're holding onto.
I know how it ends.

00:01:23.753 --> 00:01:24.972
JONATHAN MAJORS
This is the beginning,

00:01:25.023 --> 00:01:26.890
and he cannot be contained.

00:01:28.089 --> 00:01:29.191
[Screams]

00:01:31.722 --> 00:01:32.704
PAUL RUDD
Something like this,

00:01:32.754 --> 00:01:35.618
which is so transportive
and visually striking,

00:01:35.669 --> 00:01:37.799
People should really
see it in a movie theater.

00:01:38.685 --> 00:01:40.820
EVANGELINE LILLY
You want it to be as big and

00:01:40.871 --> 00:01:44.149
as visceral and consuming as possible.

00:01:44.199 --> 00:01:45.694
PAUL RUDD
Audiences are going to watch this and

00:01:45.753 --> 00:01:47.523
go I can't believe this is happening.

00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:50.257
It's going to be bonkers.

00:01:51.015 --> 00:01:52.172
SCOTT LANG
It's like we're camping.

00:01:52.223 --> 00:01:53.390
CASSIE LANG
We've never been camping.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:54.658
SCOTT LANG
But we've always talked about it.

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.710
♪♪

